' Associations JPA explicites
User "*" -- "*" Role : roles
Role "*" -- "*" Permission : permissions
Machine "1" *-- "0..*" Sensor : sensors
Sensor "1" -- "0..*" SensorData : readings
Machine "1" -- "0..*" EnvironmentalTelemetry : telemetry
Machine "1" -- "0..*" MachineTechnicianAssignment : assignments
MachineTechnicianAssignment "*" --> "1" User : technician
MachineTechnicianAssignment "*" --> "1" User : assignedBy
InventoryUsage "*" --> "1" Part : part
ReorderRequest "*" --> "1" Part : part
StockOrder "*" --> "1" Part : part
StockOrder "1" -- "1" ReorderRequest : reorderRequest
StockOrder "*" --> "0..1" Supplier : supplier
MachineFailureReport "1" *-- "0..*" MachineFailureReportPart : requiredParts
CostMachine "1" -- "0..*" FailureEvent : failures
CostMachine "1" -- "0..*" MaintenanceAction : actions
MaintenanceAction "*" -- "*" MaintenancePart : parts
MaintenanceRapport "1" *-- "0..*" RapportPart : parts
MaintenanceRapport "1" *-- "0..*" ChecklistItem : checklistItems
SupportTicket "1" *-- "0..*" PortalMessage : messages

' References logiques par identifiants
User .. UserPreference : userId
Machine .. SensorTelemetry : machineId
Machine .. MachineEvent : machineId
Machine .. MachineSimulationState : machineId
Machine .. Maintenance : machineId
Machine .. Task : machineId
Machine .. MaintenanceRecommendation : machineId
Machine .. PredictionRecord : machineId
Machine .. PredictionHistory : machineId
Machine .. Alert : machineId
Machine .. ExpenseReport : machineId
Machine .. MaintenanceRapport : machineId
Machine .. CustomerMachineLink : machineId
Machine .. Warranty : machineId
Machine .. Invoice : machineId
Machine .. SupportTicket : machineId
Machine .. CalendarEvent : machineId
Machine .. MachineFailureReport : machineId
Machine .. PredictiveActionAudit : machineId
Machine .. Notification : machineId
Machine .. NlpAnalysis : machineId
Machine .. NlpImageAnalysis : machineId

Maintenance .. Task : maintenanceId
Maintenance .. MaintenanceRecommendation : resultingMaintenanceId
Maintenance .. PartReservation : maintenanceId
Task .. ExpenseReport : maintenanceTaskId
Task .. MaintenanceRapport : taskId
Task .. CalendarEvent : taskId
User .. Maintenance : assignedTechnicianId / approvedBy
User .. Invoice : customerUserId
User .. SupportTicket : customerUserId / assignedTo
User .. CustomerMachineLink : userId
User .. PartReservation : reservedBy
User .. ReorderRequest : requestedBy / approvedBy
PredictionRecord .. Notification : predictionRecordId
SupportTicket .. PortalMessage : ticketId
Attachment .. NlpImageAnalysis : attachmentId
Part .. PartReservation : partId
Part .. MachineFailureReportPart : partId
WorkOrderTemplate .. RecurringMaintenanceRule : workOrderTemplateId
RecurringMaintenanceRule .. Machine : machineId
RecurringMaintenanceRule .. Maintenance : lastGeneratedMaintenanceId
Comment .. AuditEvent : entityType / entityId

' Sous-modele de cout : CostMachine.machineId cible CoreMachine.id
Machine .. CostMachine : machineId

note "Les classes dont les liens sont en pointilles stockent uniquement un identifiant Long dans le code source.\nLes cardinalites indiquent la dependance metier, pas une contrainte JPA necessairement declaree." as N1
N1 .. Machine

@enduml